        "editor": "<p style=\"margin:0;max-width:615px;\">There could not be a more perfect match for Pepper, the beautiful Sunshine Coast and working with a client like Surf Life Saving Queensland.</p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-top:20px;max-width:615px;\">Over the past several years, Pepper has partnered with SLSQ across a wide range of projects, delivering professional video production, photography, and drone content that supports training, recruitment, and community engagement initiatives across Queensland.</p>",
