       "id": "0ccd95ec",
       "elType": "widget",
       "widgetType": "text-editor",
       "settings": {
        "editor": "<p style=\"margin:0;max-width:560px;\">From documenting live training days in the ocean, to working alongside Westpac Life Saver Rescue Helicopter pilots, our team has captured content in fast-moving, high-risk environments where experience and preparation matter. Much of our work with SLSQ takes place where it counts most — on the beach, filming in real conditions, with real people, doing real lifesaving work.</p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-top:20px;max-width:560px;\">Pepper is fully equipped to produce high-quality video, photography, and aerial drone footage in challenging coastal environments. Our ability to operate efficiently in wind, salt, heat, and water has made us a trusted Sunshine Coast video production partner for organisations that need results without compromise.</p>",
        "text_color": "#55575C",
        "typography_typography": "custom",
        "typography_font_family": "Montserrat",
        "typography_font_size": {
