       "settings": {
        "editor": "<p style=\"margin:0;max-width:560px;\">In 2025, SLSQ invited Pepper to document the Advanced Life Saving Development Program (ALDP) for the second time — a testament to the trust built through our ongoing collaboration.</p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-top:20px;max-width:560px;\">The crew packed the Pepper van and headed across to North Stradbroke Island, capturing an action-packed weekend of elite training, teamwork, and surf conditions. Working in a remote coastal location required a production team that could move fast, adapt quickly, and maintain broadcast-level quality throughout.</p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-top:20px;max-width:560px;\">The final content highlights the intensity, professionalism, and camaraderie of the ALDP, supporting SLSQ’s mission to develop the next generation of surf lifesaving leaders through high-quality training program videography.</p>",
